CHAPTER.VERS:
before the decree brings forth, [before] the day passes as the chaff, before the fierce anger of Yahweh comes on you

          {+}
        , before the day of Yahweh's anger comes on you

          {+}
        .

Seek

          {+}
         Yahweh, all you

          {+}
         meek of the earth, that have kept his ordinances; seek

          {+}
         righteousness, seek

          {+}
         meekness: it may be you

          {+}
         will be hid in the day of Yahweh's anger.

Woe to the inhabitants of the seacoast, the nation of the Cherethites! The word of Yahweh is against you

          {+}
        , O Canaan, the land of the Philistines; I will destroy you, that there will be no inhabitant.

You

          {+}
         Ethiopians also, they are slain by my sword.
